 "Каков периметр ACDEG?": "<figure class=\"st\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 640 530\" width=\"100%\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" font-family=\"ui-sans-serif,-apple-system,sans-serif\"><line x1=\"70\" y1=\"488\" x2=\"566\" y2=\"488\" stroke=\"var(--muted)\" stroke-width=\"2.2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"/><line x1=\"566\" y1=\"488\" x2=\"566\" y2=\"232\" stroke=\"var(--muted)\" stroke-width=\"2.2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"/><line x1=\"566\" y1=\"232\" x2=\"166\" y2=\"232\" stroke=\"var(--muted)\" stroke-width=\"2.2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"/><line x1=\"310\" y1=\"40\" x2=\"310\" y2=\"488\" stroke=\"var(--muted)\" stroke-width=\"2.2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"/><line x1=\"310\" y1=\"40\" x2=\"566\" y2=\"232\" stroke=\"var(--muted)\" stroke-width=\"2.2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"/><line x1=\"310\" y1=\"40\" x2=\"70\" y2=\"360\" stroke=\"var(--muted)\" stroke-width=\"2.2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"/><line x1=\"70\" y1=\"360\" x2=\"70\" y2=\"488\" stroke=\"var(--muted)\" stroke-width=\"2.2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"/><line x1=\"70\" y1=\"360\" x2=\"310\" y2=\"360\" stroke=\"var(--muted)\" stroke-width=\"2.2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"/><circle cx=\"70\" cy=\"488\" r=\"4.5\" fill=\"#e8eef6\"/><text x=\"58\" y=\"514\" fill=\"#e8eef6\" font-size=\"18\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"600\">A</text><circle cx=\"310\" cy=\"488\" r=\"4.5\" fill=\"#e8eef6\"/><text x=\"310\" y=\"518\" fill=\"#e8eef6\" font-size=\"18\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"600\">B</text><circle cx=\"566\" cy=\"488\" r=\"4.5\" fill=\"#e8eef6\"/><text x=\"578\" y=\"514\" fill=\"#e8eef6\" font-size=\"18\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"600\">C</text><circle cx=\"566\" cy=\"232\" r=\"4.5\" fill=\"#e8eef6\"/><text x=\"582\" y=\"230\" fill=\"#e8eef6\" font-size=\"18\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"600\">D</text><circle cx=\"310\" cy=\"232\" r=\"4.5\" fill=\"#e8eef6\"/><text x=\"324\" y=\"230\" fill=\"#e8eef6\" font-size=\"18\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"600\">I</text><circle cx=\"166\" cy=\"232\" r=\"4.5\" fill=\"#e8eef6\"/><text x=\"152\" y=\"230\" fill=\"#e8eef6\" font-size=\"18\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"600\">F</text><circle cx=\"70\" cy=\"360\" r=\"4.5\" fill=\"#e8eef6\"/><text x=\"54\" y=\"360\" fill=\"#e8eef6\" font-size=\"18\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"600\">G</text><circle cx=\"310\" cy=\"360\" r=\"4.5\" fill=\"#e8eef6\"/><text x=\"326\" y=\"372\" fill=\"#e8eef6\" font-size=\"18\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"600\">H</text><circle cx=\"310\" cy=\"40\" r=\"4.5\" fill=\"#e8eef6\"/><text x=\"310\" y=\"32\" fill=\"#e8eef6\" font-size=\"18\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"600\">E</text></svg><figcaption>Рисунок условия по оригиналу (он начерчен в масштабе). Внизу — прямоугольник ABHG и квадрат BCDI; H — середина BI. Над I — вершина E: из неё вниз идут EB (через I), ED и EG (через F). F, I и D лежат на одной горизонтали.</figcaption></figure>",
 "Кирпичики (так в курсе зовут буквы": "<figure class=\"st\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 640 530\" width=\"100%\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" font-family=\"ui-sans-serif,-apple-system,sans-serif\"><line x1=\"70\" y1=\"488\" x2=\"310\" y2=\"488\" stroke=\"var(--muted)\" stroke-width=\"2.2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"/><line x1=\"310\" y1=\"488\" x2=\"566\" y2=\"488\" stroke=\"var(--muted)\" stroke-width=\"2.2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"/><line x1=\"566\" y1=\"488\" x2=\"566\" y2=\"232\" stroke=\"var(--muted)\" stroke-width=\"2.2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"/><line x1=\"566\" y1=\"232\" x2=\"310\" y2=\"232\" stroke=\"var(--muted)\" stroke-width=\"2.2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"/><line x1=\"310\" y1=\"232\" x2=\"310\" y2=\"488\" stroke=\"var(--muted)\" stroke-width=\"2.2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"/><line x1=\"70\" y1=\"360\" x2=\"70\" y2=\"488\" stroke=\"var(--muted)\" stroke-width=\"2.2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"/><line x1=\"70\" y1=\"360\" x2=\"310\" y2=\"360\" stroke=\"var(--muted)\" stroke-width=\"2.2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"/><line x1=\"310\" y1=\"232\" x2=\"310\" y2=\"40\" stroke=\"var(--blue)\" stroke-width=\"3.2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"/><line x1=\"310\" y1=\"40\" x2=\"566\" y2=\"232\" stroke=\"var(--gold)\" stroke-width=\"3.2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"/><line x1=\"166\" y1=\"232\" x2=\"310\" y2=\"232\" stroke=\"var(--green)\" stroke-width=\"3.2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"/><line x1=\"310\" y1=\"40\" x2=\"166\" y2=\"232\" stroke=\"var(--red)\" stroke-width=\"3.2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"/><line x1=\"166\" y1=\"232\" x2=\"70\" y2=\"360\" stroke=\"var(--dim)\" stroke-width=\"2.2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"/><text x=\"190.0\" y=\"514.0\" fill=\"var(--red)\" font-size=\"19\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"600\">b</text><text x=\"438.0\" y=\"514.0\" fill=\"var(--ink)\" font-size=\"19\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"600\">s</text><text x=\"582.0\" y=\"366.0\" fill=\"var(--ink)\" font-size=\"19\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"600\">s</text><text x=\"438.0\" y=\"254.0\" fill=\"var(--ink)\" font-size=\"19\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"600\">s</text><text x=\"296.0\" y=\"142.0\" fill=\"var(--blue)\" font-size=\"19\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"600\">p</text><text x=\"452.0\" y=\"130.0\" fill=\"var(--gold)\" font-size=\"19\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"600\">q</text><text x=\"238.0\" y=\"224.0\" fill=\"var(--green)\" font-size=\"19\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"600\">r</text><text x=\"222.0\" y=\"134.0\" fill=\"var(--red)\" font-size=\"19\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"600\">b</text><text x=\"190.0\" y=\"352.0\" fill=\"var(--red)\" font-size=\"19\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"600\">b</text><text x=\"40.0\" y=\"430.0\" fill=\"var(--muted)\" font-size=\"19\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"600\">s : 2</text><circle cx=\"70\" cy=\"488\" r=\"4.5\" fill=\"#e8eef6\"/><text x=\"58\" y=\"514\" fill=\"#e8eef6\" font-size=\"18\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"600\">A</text><circle cx=\"310\" cy=\"488\" r=\"4.5\" fill=\"#e8eef6\"/><text x=\"310\" y=\"518\" fill=\"#e8eef6\" font-size=\"18\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"600\">B</text><circle cx=\"566\" cy=\"488\" r=\"4.5\" fill=\"#e8eef6\"/><text x=\"578\" y=\"514\" fill=\"#e8eef6\" font-size=\"18\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"600\">C</text><circle cx=\"566\" cy=\"232\" r=\"4.5\" fill=\"#e8eef6\"/><text x=\"582\" y=\"230\" fill=\"#e8eef6\" font-size=\"18\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"600\">D</text><circle cx=\"310\" cy=\"232\" r=\"4.5\" fill=\"#e8eef6\"/><text x=\"324\" y=\"230\" fill=\"#e8eef6\" font-size=\"18\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"600\">I</text><circle cx=\"166\" cy=\"232\" r=\"4.5\" fill=\"#e8eef6\"/><text x=\"152\" y=\"230\" fill=\"#e8eef6\" font-size=\"18\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"600\">F</text><circle cx=\"70\" cy=\"360\" r=\"4.5\" fill=\"#e8eef6\"/><text x=\"54\" y=\"360\" fill=\"#e8eef6\" font-size=\"18\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"600\">G</text><circle cx=\"310\" cy=\"360\" r=\"4.5\" fill=\"#e8eef6\"/><text x=\"326\" y=\"372\" fill=\"#e8eef6\" font-size=\"18\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"600\">H</text><circle cx=\"310\" cy=\"40\" r=\"4.5\" fill=\"#e8eef6\"/><text x=\"310\" y=\"32\" fill=\"#e8eef6\" font-size=\"18\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"600\">E</text></svg><figcaption>Кирпичики на чертеже. Внизу s — сторона квадрата, b — ширина прямоугольника; его высота GA = BH = s : 2. Три неизвестных отрезка у вершины E: p = IE (синяя), q = ED (золотая), r = FI (зелёная). Красным — всё, что равно b: AB, GH и косой отрезок EF (по условию EF = GH).</figcaption></figure>",
 "Каждый неизвестный отрезок попадает в сумму дважды": "<figure class='st fx'><svg viewBox='-24 -14 200 120' width='100%' role='img' aria-label='Три уравнения складываются в одну строку, где каждый неизвестный отрезок встречается дважды'><rect x='0' y='0' width='18' height='9' fill='#5fd38d' fill-opacity='.22' stroke='#5fd38d' stroke-width='0.8'/><text x='9.0' y='6.4' fill='#5fd38d' font-size='4.8' text-anchor='middle' font-weight='600'>r</text><rect x='18' y='0' width='24' height='9' fill='#5ba8f5' fill-opacity='.22' stroke='#5ba8f5' stroke-width='0.8'/><text x='30.0' y='6.4' fill='#5ba8f5' font-size='4.8' text-anchor='middle' font-weight='600'>p</text><text x='-4' y='6.4' fill='#93a1b1' font-size='4.4' text-anchor='end'>(1)</text><text x='46' y='6.4' fill='#93a1b1' font-size='4.8' text-anchor='start' font-weight='600'>= 42</text><rect x='0' y='20' width='24' height='9' fill='#5ba8f5' fill-opacity='.22' stroke='#5ba8f5' stroke-width='0.8'/><text x='12.0' y='26.4' fill='#5ba8f5' font-size='4.8' text-anchor='middle' font-weight='600'>p</text><rect x='24' y='20' width='40' height='9' fill='#f0a83c' fill-opacity='.22' stroke='#f0a83c' stroke-width='0.8'/><text x='44.0' y='26.4' fill='#f0a83c' font-size='4.8' text-anchor='middle' font-weight='600'>q</text><text x='-4' y='26.4' fill='#93a1b1' font-size='4.4' text-anchor='end'>(2)</text><text x='68' y='26.4' fill='#93a1b1' font-size='4.8' text-anchor='start' font-weight='600'>= 64</text><rect x='0' y='40' width='40' height='9' fill='#f0a83c' fill-opacity='.22' stroke='#f0a83c' stroke-width='0.8'/><text x='20.0' y='46.4' fill='#f0a83c' font-size='4.8' text-anchor='middle' font-weight='600'>q</text><rect x='40' y='40' width='18' height='9' fill='#5fd38d' fill-opacity='.22' stroke='#5fd38d' stroke-width='0.8'/><text x='49.0' y='46.4' fill='#5fd38d' font-size='4.8' text-anchor='middle' font-weight='600'>r</text><text x='-4' y='46.4' fill='#93a1b1' font-size='4.4' text-anchor='end'>(3)</text><text x='62' y='46.4' fill='#93a1b1' font-size='4.8' text-anchor='start' font-weight='600'>= 58</text><rect class='sl' style='--d:0.7s;--to:translate(0px,46px)' x='0' y='20' width='24' height='9' fill='#5ba8f5' fill-opacity='.30' stroke='#5ba8f5' stroke-width='1'/><rect class='sl' style='--d:1.0s;--to:translate(6px,66px)' x='18' y='0' width='24' height='9' fill='#5ba8f5' fill-opacity='.30' stroke='#5ba8f5' stroke-width='1'/><rect class='sl' style='--d:1.4s;--to:translate(24px,46px)' x='24' y='20' width='40' height='9' fill='#f0a83c' fill-opacity='.30' stroke='#f0a83c' stroke-width='1'/><rect class='sl' style='--d:1.8s;--to:translate(88px,26px)' x='0' y='40' width='40' height='9' fill='#f0a83c' fill-opacity='.30' stroke='#f0a83c' stroke-width='1'/><rect class='sl' style='--d:2.1s;--to:translate(128px,66px)' x='0' y='0' width='18' height='9' fill='#5fd38d' fill-opacity='.30' stroke='#5fd38d' stroke-width='1'/><rect class='sl' style='--d:2.5s;--to:translate(106px,26px)' x='40' y='40' width='18' height='9' fill='#5fd38d' fill-opacity='.30' stroke='#5fd38d' stroke-width='1'/><text class='fi' style='--d:2.9s' x='12.0' y='72.4' fill='#5ba8f5' font-size='4.8' text-anchor='middle' font-weight='600'>p</text><text class='fi' style='--d:2.9s' x='36.0' y='72.4' fill='#5ba8f5' font-size='4.8' text-anchor='middle' font-weight='600'>p</text><text class='fi' style='--d:2.9s' x='68.0' y='72.4' fill='#f0a83c' font-size='4.8' text-anchor='middle' font-weight='600'>q</text><text class='fi' style='--d:2.9s' x='108.0' y='72.4' fill='#f0a83c' font-size='4.8' text-anchor='middle' font-weight='600'>q</text><text class='fi' style='--d:2.9s' x='137.0' y='72.4' fill='#5fd38d' font-size='4.8' text-anchor='middle' font-weight='600'>r</text><text class='fi' style='--d:2.9s' x='155.0' y='72.4' fill='#5fd38d' font-size='4.8' text-anchor='middle' font-weight='600'>r</text><g class='fi' style='--d:3.2s' fill='none' stroke='#93a1b1' stroke-width='.6'><path d='M0 79.5V83.5M0 81.5H164M164 79.5V83.5'/></g><text class='fi' style='--d:3.5s' x='82' y='93' fill='#e8eef6' font-size='5.6' text-anchor='middle' font-weight='600'>2 · (p + q + r) = 42 + 64 + 58 = 164</text><text class='fi' style='--d:3.9s' x='82' y='102.5' fill='#5fd38d' font-size='5.6' text-anchor='middle' font-weight='600'>p + q + r = 82</text></svg><figcaption>Каждый неизвестный отрезок входит ровно в два из трёх уравнений — поэтому все шесть кусочков выкладываются в одну строку парами: два p, два q, два r. Длина этой строки — 42 + 64 + 58 = 164, а это ровно два раза p + q + r, значит p + q + r = 82.</figcaption></figure>"
